@teledrive/gramjs-browser Phase 1

This package records and audits a vendored snapshot of npm package telegram@2.26.22.
The upstream MIT license and GramJS copyright notice remain in
vendor/telegram-2.26.22/LICENSE and must travel with that snapshot.

This project package currently exposes no upstream runtime. Runtime implementation,
browser compatibility changes, and any redistribution of derived code require a
separate streaming audit and maintainer review.
